---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Privacy information"
  eyebrow="YOUR PRIVACY MATTERS"
  description="How this website and the appointment request integration handle information."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This static website has no patient accounts, appointment database, payment
      processing or on-site medical intake. No analytics or marketing scripts
      have been added.
    </p>
    <h2>Appointment requests</h2>
    <p>
      When connected, the request button opens the clinic’s Google Form.
      Information submitted there is handled through Google Forms and any linked
      clinic-managed Google Sheet, rather than this website. Google’s own
      privacy terms apply to its services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Share only the details needed to request a consultation. Avoid sending
      sensitive medical details through the form.
    </p>
    <h2>Patient experience videos</h2>
    <p>
      Video previews make no YouTube requests until you choose to load a player.
      The player uses YouTube’s privacy-enhanced domain, but playing a video
      connects to YouTube and is subject to its privacy practices. The Watch on
      YouTube links open YouTube in a new tab.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and access</h2>
    <p>
      Hosting and network providers may process technical request information to
      serve this website. The final hosting setup and clinic data-handling
      policy must be confirmed before launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Before production launch</h2>
    <p>
      The clinic’s privacy contact, retention period, access arrangements and
      consent wording are awaiting approval. A final clinic-approved privacy
      policy will replace this information before production cutover.
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>
